# ACC Guardrails (절대 금지)

- Browser/JSSP client: `fetch`, `Promise`, `.finally`, `classList`, `forEach`, `alert`, `confirm`
- ES6: `let`, `const`, arrow `=>`, template literals, `Array.map/filter/find/includes`
- CSS: `flex`, `grid`, `vh`, CSS variables (`var(--*)`), `calc()`
- API: `xtk:workflow#Spawn` (starts WF — never for create/clone)
- XTK: `FormatDate`, `GetDate` in form scripts (XTK-170016)
- Log: do not invent/skip/reorder `docs/log/log.md` numbers
- Baseline: do not revert #133 / #135 / #137 / #141
- Commit: do not mix form XML + JSSP layout changes in one commit without deploy note
- Deploy order: schema → js library → form/navtree → JSSP
- Cache litmus: Studio URL must show `v=<n>`; missing `v=` = stale client
